#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/about/citation.md:1
#: 4ad8fe40c21f4a83b7fde250ae2cf7fb
msgid "Citation"
msgstr "引用方法 (Citation)"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/about/citation.md:3
#: 1879b93897604a839b5718493b1c4e47
msgid "If you use GWexpy in your research or publications, please cite it as follows."
msgstr "GWexpy を研究や論文等で使用した場合は、以下の形式で引用していただけると幸いです。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/about/citation.md:5
#: 6bd70f922e9b453994a26b9956c5598b
msgid "BibTeX Entry"
msgstr "論文での引用 (BibTeX)"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/about/citation.md:7
#: 7a5f8a88c07648dca19fe2484a661f6c
msgid ""
"For reproducibility of analysis results and continued maintenance of the software, "
"please use the following BibTeX entry."
msgstr "解析結果の再現性とソフトウェアの継続的なメンテナンスのために、以下の BibTeX エントリを使用してください。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/about/citation.md:19
#: 1a60ff589da041c6816236cfdd494432
msgid ""
"The `version` field above is pinned to the release current at the time this page was "
"written; check the [Changelog](changelog.md) for the version you actually used."
msgstr ""
"上記 BibTeX の `version` フィールドは、このページを書いた時点の最新リリースに固定されています。実際に使用したバージョンは "
"[Changelog](changelog.md) で確認してください。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/about/citation.md:21
#: 9935c536647d48c4b30621f4fbc2f05f
msgid "CITATION.cff"
msgstr "CITATION.cff"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/about/citation.md:23
#: b6a85fa638e948e4abe7e0dd74a6039c
msgid ""
"You can also retrieve citation information directly from GitHub using the "
"[**CITATION.cff**](https://github.com/tatsuki-washimi/gwexpy/blob/main/CITATION.cff) "
"file located in the root directory of the repository."
msgstr ""
"リポジトリのルートディレクトリにある [**CITATION.cff**](https://github.com/tatsuki-"
"washimi/gwexpy/blob/main/CITATION.cff) ファイルを使用して、GitHub 上で直接引用情報を取得することもできます。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/about/citation.md:27
#: 9619245efd7548b99bb951d4eecedc05
msgid "Related Works"
msgstr "関連する先行研究"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/about/citation.md:29
#: 7c1c4c0cbf1448b380bbe5eccf370cd0
msgid ""
"GWexpy builds on the following software. Cite the specific versions used in your work"
" according to their own guidance:"
msgstr "GWexpy は次のソフトウェアを基盤としています。使用した版は、それぞれの引用ガイドに従って引用してください。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/about/citation.md:31
#: 9e0ea69a1cd3457ab2cafee6bca6ff23
msgid ""
"**GWpy**: use the [GWpy citation "
"guide](https://gwpy.github.io/docs/stable/citing.html) to select the DOI for the "
"version used."
msgstr ""
"**GWpy**：使用した版の DOI は、[GWpy の引用ガイド](https://gwpy.github.io/docs/stable/citing.html) "
"で選択してください。"

#: ../gwexpy-pr487-docs-update/docs_redesign/about/citation.md:32
#: 86128aaa87244a56aa8763e2adfdc76c
msgid ""
"**Astropy**: follow [Astropy's acknowledgment and citation "
"guidance](https://www.astropy.org/acknowledging.html), which lists the project papers"
" and version-specific BibTeX metadata."
msgstr ""
"**Astropy**：[Astropy の謝辞と引用ガイド](https://www.astropy.org/acknowledging.html) "
"に従ってください。プロジェクト論文と版固有の BibTeX メタデータが掲載されています。"

#~ msgid "**GWpy**: `Duncan Macleod et al., gwpy/gwpy: ...`"
#~ msgstr "**GWpy**: `Duncan Macleod et al., gwpy/gwpy: ...`"

#~ msgid "**Astropy**: `Astropy Collaboration et al., ...`"
#~ msgstr "**Astropy**: `Astropy Collaboration et al., ...`"

